        "text": "PR #90 (ATL detection for token-report) was created earlier today but became immediately DIRTY because it included 6 volatile files despite the targeted-staging instruction. Text-only warnings are insufficient — the agent sometimes uses broad staging regardless. This creates a 72h dead zone where the improvement can't be merged (conflicts) and can't be re-proposed (dedup check blocks it).",
